# The deployment VLAN: installers live here (dynamic, PXE - no host
# lines). gw= stays on the deploy server until the router cutover.
DEPLOY						10.100.0.0/24		R1		100	nat;native;pkg=servers

# The hypervisors: a proper MGMT network (they used to squat in the
# colo network with foreign addresses). Puppet-enrolled by hand,
# never deployed. The gateway is the router's MGMT leg (COLO<->MGMT
# routes through it - the pve directory binds need the return path).
MGMT						10.10.10.0/24		R1		10	othernet
#$ pve1.colo.notproduction.net			10.10.10.11					os=pve;pkg=pve;webname=pve1.dh.notproduction.net
#$ pve2.colo.notproduction.net			10.10.10.12					os=pve;pkg=pve;webname=pve2.dh.notproduction.net

# The slirp/user-net side of the bench: the router's outside leg and
# the workstation hostfwd targets live here (qemu's gateway at .2).
OUTSIDE						10.0.2.0/24		-		-	othernet;gw=10.0.2.2
